    "name": "Chained Runes",
    "steam_appid": 2962290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/0a51577e4b172dfc9d6fb219079251f1.poster.avif?t=1740587594\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/0a51577e4b172dfc9d6fb219079251f1.webm?t=1740587594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>What else are the <strong>Gormnoq</strong> up to?<br>Break into their lair, progress to the King and retrieve what they've stolen.<br><br>Chained Runes is a <strong>deckbuilding </strong>game with <strong>runes</strong> that focuses on <strong>reflection </strong>and <strong>anticipation</strong>.<br>Place them as best you can in your <strong>chain</strong> to <i>optimize</i> their effects. <i>Analyze </i>your opponents and <i>anticipate </i>their actions to move forward.<br><i>Discover </i>the different runes, abilities and talents, and create an optimized deck to defeat all the Gormnoqs in your path and reach the king.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/34df26790150c6f52122a51ec14b83a2.poster.avif?t=1740587594\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/34df26790150c6f52122a51ec14b83a2.webm?t=1740587594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic battles, rich in possibilities</strong></h2>Get your brain working. Chained Runes requires a good dose of <strong>reflection</strong>, <strong>anticipation </strong>and <strong>analysis</strong>.<br>Battles revolve around 3 elements:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Runes</strong>: the game's main mechanic, place them in your chain to play their effects successively.<br></li><li><strong>Abilities</strong>: allow you to play an effect instantly, available only 1x per turn.<br></li><li><strong>Talents</strong>: Passives that play effects when their trigger's condition occurs.</li></ul><br>Find synergies to optimize your turns and unleash your true power.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/944af748451d5ca78eb9bc9f01e43829.poster.avif?t=1740587594\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/944af748451d5ca78eb9bc9f01e43829.webm?t=1740587594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your Codex</strong></h2>Choose 3 <strong>Arcanes</strong> from the 5 available.<br>Each Arcane specializes in one aspect of the battle system <i>(Offensiveness, Survival, Wounds, Aura, Runes)</i> and has its own set of associated runes, abilities and talents.<br>Mix and match as you want to play the way that suits you best.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/b54939d7183479d78da7920d9a461909.poster.avif?t=1740587594\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/b54939d7183479d78da7920d9a461909.webm?t=1740587594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected encounters</strong></h2>Scour the lair's <strong>3 floors</strong>, encountering a variety of wacky Gormnoqs room after room.<br>Be on the lookout for <strong>special encounters</strong> scattered around each floor. Chests, tougher enemies and much more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/8776c229c2138c0cd3e71bd8ce1a4509.poster.avif?t=1740587594\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/8776c229c2138c0cd3e71bd8ce1a4509.webm?t=1740587594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take up the challenge!</strong></h2>The King is not so easily approached. Don't expect to gain power with every defeat.<br><strong>Discover</strong> and <strong>learn</strong> everything you can do in <i>Chained runes</i>. Optimize what you've learned to go further and further.<br>The game has a <strong>fixed difficulty</strong>, so it's up to you to master it enough to see it through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/bde1be931a372a873ede704ca2539bd1.poster.avif?t=1740587594\" width=500 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962290/extras/bde1be931a372a873ede704ca2539bd1.webm?t=1740587594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The game is made with a very small team. The English localization is not done by a professional third party, so expect approximations and mistakes... . Sorry about that.</strong></li></ul></i>",
